   *
   * Original code iterated column-by-column (j outer, i inner), which
   * walks the data matrix with a large stride and hurts cache locality.
   *
   * Here we:
   *   - Initialize mean[j] to zero.
   *   - Traverse the matrix row-by-row (i outer, j inner) so that each
   *     row of 'data' is accessed contiguously in memory.
   *
